# Generic shapes that never belong in a shared repository. One extended regex
# per line, matched case-insensitively. Names of clients, partners and people
# go in .leak-denylist, which is gitignored.

# Links into private chat, session or project pages
claude\.ai/(code/)?(session|project|artifact)
chatgpt\.com/(c|share)/
# Personal home directories
/Users/[a-z]
/home/[a-z]+/
# Private keys
-----BEGIN [A-Z ]*PRIVATE KEY-----
